      <title>30年期美债收益率创19年新高，全球资产承压</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260818/30%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%9F%E7%BE%8E%E5%80%BA%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%8E%87%E5%88%9B19%E5%B9%B4%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%A7%E6%89%BF%E5%8E%8B/</link>
